<h2>humanaifit.com Privacy Policy Now Published</h2>

<p>We are pleased to announce that our <a href="/en/privacy/">Privacy Policy</a> is now available in both Chinese and English.</p>

<p>This policy covers how we collect, use, and protect your personal information — whether you use the CBAM compliance diagnostic tool, take the AI Literacy Assessment, or join our "AI Era Survival Guide" knowledge planet community.</p>

<p style="font-size:1.1rem;font-weight:600;">Products Covered</p>
<p>This Privacy Policy applies to the following three products:</p>
<ul>
  <li><strong>CBAM Carbon Compliance Diagnostic Tool</strong> (cbam.humanaifit.com) — EU carbon tariff compliance assessment for exporters</li>
  <li><strong>AI Literacy Assessment</strong> (humanaifit.com/diagnosis) — Personal AI capability evaluation and growth recommendations</li>
  <li><strong>"AI Era Survival Guide" Knowledge Planet</strong> (https://t.zsxq.com/GJMJ3) — AI era learning community</li>
</ul>

<p style="font-size:1.1rem;font-weight:600;margin-top:32px;">Core Commitments</p>

<div style="margin:16px 0;padding:12px 16px;background:#e8f5e9;border-radius:8px;border-left:4px solid #4caf50;">
<strong>🛡️ CBAM Diagnostic Data Never Uploaded</strong>
<p style="margin:4px 0 0;font-size:13px;">Your HS codes, product information, and export volumes entered in the CBAM tool stay in your browser only (localStorage) — never uploaded to our servers.</p>
</div>

<div style="margin:16px 0;padding:12px 16px;background:#e8f5e9;border-radius:8px;border-left:4px solid #4caf50;">
<strong>🛡️ AI Literacy Assessment Data Never Uploaded</strong>
<p style="margin:4px 0 0;font-size:13px;">Your assessment answers and results likewise stay in your browser (localStorage) — never uploaded to our servers.</p>
</div>

<div style="margin:16px 0;padding:12px 16px;background:#e8f5e9;border-radius:8px;border-left:4px solid #4caf50;">
<strong>🤝 We Do Not Share Your Personal Data</strong>
<p style="margin:4px 0 0;font-size:13px;">We never sell, trade, or transfer your personal information to third parties — including discussions within the "AI Era Survival Guide" Knowledge Planet community — except with your explicit consent or when required by law.</p>
</div>

<p style="font-size:1.1rem;font-weight:600;margin-top:32px;">Key Terms Summary</p>

<p><strong>What we collect:</strong> Name, email, company name (when you submit a form); server access logs (for operations); Knowledge Planet nickname and activity level (for community management).</p>
<p><strong>How we use it:</strong> Delivering CBAM reports, AI literacy reports, and "AI Era Survival Guide" materials you request; improving website and community experience.</p>
<p><strong>Data retention:</strong> Server data ≤12 months after last interaction; localStorage auto-expires in 7 days; Knowledge Planet content retained per platform rules.</p>
<p><strong>Your rights:</strong> Access, rectification, erasure, restriction, portability, withdrawal of consent.</p>
<p><strong>Legal basis:</strong> PIPL Art. 13 (consent), GDPR Art. 6 (consent).</p>
<p><strong>Contact:</strong> privacy@humanaifit.com — 72-hour response commitment.</p>

<p style="margin-top:32px;">Read the full policy: <a href="/en/privacy/">→ English Privacy Policy</a></p>
